% holding-blocked: The original is fully notated and its listening reference is verified, but it has not been played or danced by a class. A Syrian or Levantine dabke educator must review the context, the dance relationship and the electronic framing, and confirm that the retitling away from "Dabke Drive" is right; a Grade 7 music/dance teacher must trial the turns and the stamp break; a second score reader must check the audit.
